sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant AgentTabBar
    participant ChatView
    participant ChatStore
    participant ChatPanel
    participant MessageList

    User->>AgentTabBar: 点击 Agent 标签
    AgentTabBar->>ChatView: emit('select', agentId)
    ChatView->>ChatStore: activeAgentId = agentId
    ChatStore-->>ChatPanel: activeAgentId 变化（computed）
    ChatPanel->>MessageList: :agentFilter="activeAgentId"
    MessageList->>MessageList: messages.filter(m => (m.agentId || 'default') === agentFilter)
    Note over MessageList: 无 agentId 的存量消息归属 "default" 标签

    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        Note over User,MessageList: 场景 2：单 Agent 会话
        User->>AgentTabBar: 仅一个标签
        AgentTabBar->>AgentTabBar: agents.length === 1 → closable=false
        Note over AgentTabBar: 不渲染 × 关闭按钮
    end
